{"abstract":"In this rule, the Bureau of Industry and Security (BIS) amends the Export Administration Regulations (EAR) by adding 16 entities to the Entity List, under the destinations of China, People's Republic of (China) (14) and Singapore (2). These entities have been determined by the U.S. Government to be acting contrary to the national security or foreign policy interests of the United States.","action":"Final rule.","agencies":[{"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF COMMERCE","name":"Commerce Department","id":54,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/commerce-department","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/54","parent_id":null,"slug":"commerce-department"},{"raw_name":"Bureau of Industry and Security","name":"Industry and Security Bureau","id":241,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/industry-and-security-bureau","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/241","parent_id":54,"slug":"industry-and-security-bureau"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2025/01/16/2025-00480.html","cfr_references":[{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"744","title":15}],"citation":"90 FR 4621","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"This rule is effective January 16, 2025.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["Docket No. 250106-0001"],"dockets":[{"supporting_documents":[],"agency_name":"BIS","documents":[{"comment_count":0,"comment_start_date":"2025-01-16","updated_at":"2025-01-30T12:56:19.966-05:00","comment_url":"https://www.regulations.gov/commenton/BIS-2025-0005-0001","allow_late_comments":false,"id":"BIS-2025-0005-0001","comment_end_date":null,"regulations_dot_gov_open_for_comment":false}],"supporting_documents_count":0,"id":"BIS-2025-0005","title":"Additions to the Entity List"}],"document_number":"2025-00480","effective_on":"2025-01-16","end_page":4624,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_order_number":null,"full_text_xml_ur